sound **if input batches are fresh source syntax**, as the specification states ([yin.vm.macro.md:459](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-ucf-rule-r/docs/design/yin.vm.macro.md:459)). The API cannot establish that provenance itself; admitting persisted batches as code would require a stamped-input design. That is deferred work, not a demonstrated commit-one bypass. No currently matching initial-store pipeline was found under `src/`. I did not rerun suites; the supplied independent lanes are green, and `git diff --check` is clean. The inaccurate audit guarantee still needs correction before this gate.\n\nVerdict: REQUEST CHANGES\nSign-off: DENIED"}}
